249
00:43:33,344 --> 00:43:38,179
I can never forget how much your forefathers have obliged me

250
00:43:38,515 --> 00:43:45,079
How can you ? Well Ramlal , even after the murder of his Uncle

251
00:43:45,422 --> 00:43:48,880
do you still believe that it wasn 't the work of some ghost ?

252
00:43:49,360 --> 00:43:55,196
Mohan , pull my leg all you want . But I 've said it before and

253
00:43:55,532 --> 00:44:00,060
I 'll say it again . Ghosts don 't kill in this manner

254
00:44:00,638 --> 00:44:08,067
I think , it 's a shrewd man posing as a ghost who 's doing it all

255
00:44:08,679 --> 00:44:14,584
But I 've heard that God punishes those who terrorize others .

256
00:44:15,753 --> 00:44:20,520
Right , I 'll go now . You 're staying back ?

257
00:44:20,758 --> 00:44:22,020
Yes

258
00:44:30,734 --> 00:44:34,261
I 'm very glad to know that you don 't believe in ghosts and spirits

259
00:44:35,506 --> 00:44:38,441
If only I would know the secret of the anklets ...

260
00:44:41,445 --> 00:44:44,278
