262
00:44:47,017 --> 00:44:50,282
You 're repeating the same mistake that your forefathers did

263
00:44:51,021 --> 00:44:53,854
Let alone ... Your family is cursed as it is

264
00:44:54,858 --> 00:44:59,818
Death is inevitable , Uncle . Anyway , we 'll meet again

265
00:45:41,605 --> 00:45:46,042
Why are you sitting in the dark ? Light the lamp , my dear

266
00:45:49,580 --> 00:45:51,514
What are you thinking about ?

267
00:45:55,486 --> 00:46:00,219
Why do the Lords of the Manor go in the swamp to die ?

268
00:46:01,558 --> 00:46:08,327
Why do they go there ... that 's very difficult to tell

269
00:46:08,732 --> 00:46:11,462
A pitch-black night ... 9 : 30 p.m. Jingle of the anklets ...

270
00:46:11,835 --> 00:46:16,636
What link does that sound have with the death of the Landlords

271
00:46:16,940 --> 00:46:18,669
is very hard to tell

272
00:46:22,045 --> 00:46:27,108
