299
00:53:30,840 --> 00:53:32,831
No , doctor ... no

300
00:53:36,813 --> 00:53:39,441
If I want , I can knock you out within 5 minutes

301
00:53:42,219 --> 00:53:47,122
See this injection ? It can kill a person in a jiffy

302
00:53:49,726 --> 00:53:51,990
No , doctor ... no !

303
00:53:52,295 --> 00:53:53,785
Brace yourself now

304
00:54:06,476 --> 00:54:09,206
Finish , eh ?

305
00:54:20,190 --> 00:54:21,623
My God !

306
00:54:22,626 --> 00:54:27,188
