308
00:54:32,269 --> 00:54:35,261
- Detective ? - Is that man dead ?

309
00:54:39,743 --> 00:54:40,710
You can go now

310
00:54:47,550 --> 00:54:50,917
- Yes ? - Wait a minute

311
00:54:54,758 --> 00:55:02,563
Well doc , if a man dies ... I mean if he 's murdered ...

312
00:55:02,999 --> 00:55:04,967
- Then ... - Then ?

313
00:55:05,201 --> 00:55:09,797
Then , you 'll have to give his death certificate ...

314
00:55:10,073 --> 00:55:13,565
I mean , a doctor will have to give it , right ?

315
00:55:15,078 --> 00:55:19,777
- If need be ... - Then , give me one in advance please

316
00:55:22,485 --> 00:55:26,581
Don 't worry . If such an opportunity arises

317
00:55:27,891 --> 00:55:31,349
I 'll be very happy to do this for you

318
00:55:32,495 --> 00:55:36,761
I 'm a doctor . I can do as I wish

319
00:55:37,267 --> 00:55:39,827
" I can do as I wish " , eh ?

320
00:55:45,642 --> 00:55:51,911
Look . If you 're a doctor , I 'm a detective too

321
00:55:52,615 --> 00:55:59,987
I too have proofs that can help me catch the killer in a jiffy

322
00:56:00,357 --> 00:56:04,987
- Really ? - Police means trouble !

323
00:56:06,129 --> 00:56:12,625
- What are you getting at ? - That 's what I 'm trying to tell

324
00:56:13,837 --> 00:56:20,037
The reward to catch the killer is Rs . 10,000 / - , right ?

325
00:56:20,610 --> 00:56:22,407
Yes - Good .

326
00:56:22,812 --> 00:56:27,613
And here there 's just one buggy which belongs to you . Right ?

327
00:56:28,184 --> 00:56:30,118
Yes - Very good

328
00:56:30,653 --> 00:56:35,681
- So ? - If you give me just 5,000 / ...

329
00:56:36,092 --> 00:56:39,152
I 'll seal my lips forever

330
00:56:41,431 --> 00:56:48,030
And I 'll scoot from this place now this very minute , if you wish

331
00:56:49,739 --> 00:56:52,207
You really are a clever detective

332
00:56:53,143 --> 00:56:57,637
You understand , eh ? Well , how about the cash ?

333
00:56:58,047 --> 00:57:01,983
- Bahadur ! - Does he keep the cash ?

334
00:57:02,285 --> 00:57:05,254
- Bahadur ! - Shall I make him lie

335
00:57:05,655 --> 00:57:07,179
on the table too ? Come , sir

336
00:57:07,657 --> 00:57:11,457
Is this man crazy ? Go and get some water !

337
00:57:11,795 --> 00:57:17,199
Okay then , I 'll go now . I 've the proof but not the witness

338
00:57:17,567 --> 00:57:20,764
That 's why I wanted to make a deal at Rs . 5,000 / -

339
00:57:21,237 --> 00:57:25,765
Even Rs . 2,000 / - Would have done

340
00:57:38,321 --> 00:57:42,519
After having turned every stone at the site of the murder

341
00:57:43,092 --> 00:57:47,529
