352
01:00:06,235 --> 01:00:07,702
You scared me back there

353
01:00:08,371 --> 01:00:10,100
Can 't you see ? It 's a python

354
01:00:10,373 --> 01:00:11,431
I know

355
01:00:34,297 --> 01:00:35,286
