361
01:01:15,605 --> 01:01:17,630
Greetings , I said , Mr. Gopichand

362
01:01:23,880 --> 01:01:30,308
Oh , Radha ... I thought , it was the ghost

363
01:01:31,421 --> 01:01:35,858
