385
01:03:19,495 --> 01:03:23,226
what 'll happen to these folks and Kumar too !

386
01:03:23,566 --> 01:03:28,094
That 's why ... Eh ? She has gone !

387
01:03:38,815 --> 01:03:43,149
I 'm trying to finish your unfinished diary , Uncle

388
01:03:44,487 --> 01:03:48,423
