735
02:00:54,647 --> 02:01:00,677
Uncle ... I always knew that you 're not hard hearted

736
02:01:04,924 --> 02:01:09,258
In this whole world you love only me , don 't you ?

737
02:01:09,562 --> 02:01:11,587
Get lost !

738
02:01:13,866 --> 02:01:17,029
I must also meet Kumar now , mustn 't I ?

739
02:01:20,506 --> 02:01:24,636
Okay , ask him to meet me in the temple near the swamp

740
02:01:24,977 --> 02:01:27,309
so that I can talk things over with him

741
02:01:27,613 --> 02:01:30,241
No ... - Go on

742
02:01:30,583 --> 02:01:32,710
Don 't waste time , my dear . - I won 't go

743
02:01:50,236 --> 02:01:54,764
So ! Tonight Kumar will be at the temple near the swamp

744
02:01:56,442 --> 02:01:59,809
Maybe , tonight is my night

745
02:02:09,155 --> 02:02:12,454
- Ramdhin ! - Sir !

746
02:02:14,093 --> 02:02:15,754
Before our secret gets out ...

747
02:02:16,762 --> 02:02:18,525
We must change the plans

748
02:02:21,033 --> 02:02:22,295
Radha !

749
02:02:36,248 --> 02:02:42,847
No , nothing very special . Just a small party at my place

750
02:02:43,923 --> 02:02:50,522
If you can attend the party , I 'll consider myself very fortunate

751
02:02:50,930 --> 02:02:55,196
At night ? Okay , I 'll come . - Thank you very much

752
02:02:57,036 --> 02:03:01,405
Greetings , Mr. Ramlal - Greetings , Mr. Gopichand

753
02:03:01,741 --> 02:03:04,141
Collecting shoots and roots are you ?

754
02:03:04,443 --> 02:03:06,274
- Yes . - I see .

755
02:03:08,581 --> 02:03:12,745
Didn 't you ask me about the killer that day ?

756
02:03:13,185 --> 02:03:16,552
I won 't now . Ever !

757
02:03:17,556 --> 02:03:20,218
If you won 't tell anyone , shall I tell you something ?

758
02:03:20,593 --> 02:03:25,929
Why should I tell anyone anything ? That day Kumar asked me

759
02:03:26,265 --> 02:03:31,328
how was Radha , but I hardly told him that she was refusing to eat !

760
02:03:31,904 --> 02:03:33,735
- Mr. Gopichand ... - Yes ?

761
02:03:36,542 --> 02:03:42,447
I 've noticed that a man hides behind that hill all day

762
02:03:43,315 --> 02:03:46,284
And then at night he 's wandering about in the swamp

763
02:03:46,886 --> 02:03:50,754
Wanders about , eh ? Then he must be the murderer

764
02:03:51,257 --> 02:03:54,021
I 'll go and set him straight right this minute !

765
02:04:45,778 --> 02:04:47,143
Hands up !

766
02:04:49,248 --> 02:04:52,581
Gopichand ? - Come along , Mr. Murderer

767
02:04:54,320 --> 02:04:58,916
Where , the police station ? - No , to the Taj Mahal at Agra !

768
02:04:59,291 --> 02:05:00,223
Come along

769
02:05:05,598 --> 02:05:09,898
Inspector ... I 've caught the murderer

770
02:05:10,503 --> 02:05:14,439
Hey you , lock him up ! Come on , hurry up

771
02:05:15,107 --> 02:05:16,472
Inspector ...

772
02:05:19,712 --> 02:05:24,206
- What 's the matter ? - Ask me , what 's not the matter !

773
02:05:24,550 --> 02:05:27,519
- I 've caught the murderer - You ?

774
02:05:27,820 --> 02:05:29,845
Yes ! - Where is he ?

775
02:05:30,189 --> 02:05:31,383
There he is !

776
02:05:35,895 --> 02:05:37,886
- Inspector ... - Yes sir ?

777
02:05:38,297 --> 02:05:39,594
Did you post the letter I sent you ?

778
02:05:39,832 --> 02:05:40,764
Yes sir

779
02:05:41,100 --> 02:05:45,127
Right . Mr. Gopichand , sit down

780
02:06:02,821 --> 02:06:10,819
Have I come to the wrong place ? Is this a police station or ...

781
02:06:12,765 --> 02:06:15,199
- There goes my reward money . - Gopichand ...

782
02:06:17,303 --> 02:06:19,863
You are interested in the reward money , eh ?

783
02:06:20,272 --> 02:06:22,968
I was , but not anymore !

784
02:06:26,579 --> 02:06:29,776
Inspector ... the D.S.P. Has called me to the city at once

785
02:06:31,383 --> 02:06:37,788
I 'll have to go by the first train . But tonight ...

786
02:06:39,124 --> 02:06:40,557
Be alert , Inspector

787
02:06:43,395 --> 02:06:45,454
You can also try your luck

788
02:06:50,669 --> 02:06:52,000
Inspector ...

789
02:06:53,439 --> 02:06:55,430
Police detective , Mr. Tripathi

790
02:07:01,847 --> 02:07:05,476
I don 't believe it . It can 't be

791
02:07:05,784 --> 02:07:08,048
Shout ! Shout all you want and ruin everything !

792
02:07:08,354 --> 02:07:10,879
- Say what you want . - Silence ! I 'll kill you !

793
02:07:11,256 --> 02:07:13,622
- Then , kill me ! - Laxman !

794
02:07:13,892 --> 02:07:19,330
No , I won 't . I won 't ... I won 't believe it

795
02:07:23,502 --> 02:07:26,198
Laxman , who 's this girl ?

796
02:07:29,008 --> 02:07:37,609
Murdered . The man who was killed that night was her husband

797
02:07:39,818 --> 02:07:45,848
- I asked you , who this girl is . - Sister . My sister

798
02:07:47,259 --> 02:07:55,724
He was a jail-breaker . My brother-in-law

799
02:07:56,035 --> 02:07:57,832
I didn 't keep him in the Manor

800
02:07:58,871 --> 02:08:04,605
He lived in the swamp . My sis asked me to signal him with a lantern

801
02:08:06,045 --> 02:08:10,539
So that she could take food to him when it was safe

802
02:08:11,483 --> 02:08:16,113
I used to tell her to make him go somewhere very far

803
02:08:17,623 --> 02:08:22,356
- But she used to cry . - And you shut her mouth every night

804
02:08:22,728 --> 02:08:28,792
So that I won 't hear her crying . - Yes

805
02:08:29,234 --> 02:08:32,567
- Then ? - I stole ...

806
02:08:33,405 --> 02:08:36,374
I only stole your black coat

807
02:08:37,776 --> 02:08:43,840
He agreed . My brother-in-law agreed to go away from here

808
02:08:45,584 --> 02:08:47,381
And then ...

809
02:08:48,687 --> 02:08:52,123
You kept your sister here without permission because you love her

810
02:08:52,658 --> 02:08:55,354
A sister who loves her husband so much that she refuses

811
02:08:55,694 --> 02:09:00,597
to accept his death . You just told her that her husband is dead ?

812
02:09:01,100 --> 02:09:04,968
Why didn 't you let her see with her own eyes that she was a widow ?

813
02:09:05,370 --> 02:09:10,467
She has gone mad . The moment she heard of her husband 's death ...

814
02:09:11,210 --> 02:09:16,807
- She became mad . - I won 't believe it

815
02:09:17,382 --> 02:09:20,613
It 's the Lords of the Manor that are cursed , not my husband

816
02:09:21,019 --> 02:09:23,954
He can 't die ! He can never die !

817
02:09:27,059 --> 02:09:31,052
- You 'll have to take care now - So what ?

818
02:09:36,435 --> 02:09:41,805
Thanks . When will the doc come ? - Should be here soon

819
02:09:53,652 --> 02:09:57,213
I 'm sorry , Kumar . I had to see a patient

820
02:09:58,390 --> 02:10:02,053
But unfortunately , I couldn 't save him

821
02:10:04,062 --> 02:10:06,087
Please sit down . I 'll just come

822
02:10:10,302 --> 02:10:12,532
- Greetings , doctor - Greetings

823
02:10:13,272 --> 02:10:15,570
Doctor , I lost this round

824
02:10:26,418 --> 02:10:31,151
" Somewhere there burns a lamp , elsewhere a heart "

825
02:10:31,590 --> 02:10:40,498
" Come and see dear beloved ...

826
02:10:40,866 --> 02:10:45,200
" what you 're destined for "

827
02:10:45,838 --> 02:10:50,275
" Somewhere there burns a lamp , elsewhere a heart "

828
02:11:35,821 --> 02:11:40,622
" I 'm neither a dream nor am I a mystery "

829
02:11:41,059 --> 02:11:45,723
" But just a plaintive cry ... "

830
02:11:54,873 --> 02:11:59,776
" I 'm neither a dream nor am I a mystery "

831
02:12:00,145 --> 02:12:04,605
" But just a plaintive cry ... "

832
02:12:04,917 --> 02:12:08,978
" Please don 't be late in coming "

833
02:12:09,421 --> 02:12:23,290
" Come and see dear beloved , what you 're destined for "

834
02:12:23,769 --> 02:12:28,433
" Somewhere there burns a lamp , elsewhere a heart "

835
02:12:49,161 --> 02:12:50,458
- Did you see Kumar ? - Yes

836
02:12:50,829 --> 02:12:54,424
- He went straight to the swamp . - To the swamp . All alone !

837
02:14:05,737 --> 02:14:07,329
- Radha ! - You !

838
02:14:07,639 --> 02:14:10,005
Had you not deceived me today , I 'd have ...

839
02:14:10,308 --> 02:14:11,673
I see

840
02:14:12,077 --> 02:14:17,140
By lying about fixing the marriage you had come to kill Kumar ...

841
02:14:18,517 --> 02:14:23,545
You wanted to widow me before I even became a bride ?

842
02:14:24,289 --> 02:14:26,723
- But why ? - Why ?

843
02:14:27,025 --> 02:14:32,964
To quench his lust , Kumar 's grandpa had kidnapped my daughter Champa

844
02:14:33,265 --> 02:14:38,032
on her wedding night . And Radha

845
02:14:38,737 --> 02:14:43,174
when I went to the Manor , to beg for your cousin 's honor ...

846
02:14:43,542 --> 02:14:47,706
But for one man 's crime you wanted to finish off the whole lineage ?

847
02:14:48,180 --> 02:14:51,741
That night , after regaining my senses , when I reached home ...

848
02:14:52,117 --> 02:14:55,712
It would 've been better had you let me die that day too

849
02:14:56,221 --> 02:14:59,213
At least I wouldn 't be standing here like this in front of you today !

850
02:14:59,491 --> 02:15:01,789
Tell me , where Kumar is . I beg you !

851
02:15:02,160 --> 02:15:03,718
Beg ?

852
02:15:04,029 --> 02:15:09,057
Not for me , but your cousin . Her soul 's disturbed . Where 's Kumar ?

853
02:15:10,001 --> 02:15:15,098
If this is how she 'll find peace , then sacrifice me , Uncle !

854
02:15:20,912 --> 02:15:24,404
Follow him ! Why did you come here ?

855
02:15:25,083 --> 02:15:28,382
- What more can a girl do ? - But I had forbidden you

856
02:15:28,720 --> 02:15:32,747
Uncle had asked me to bring Kumar in the temple near here

857
02:15:33,125 --> 02:15:35,525
- To solve the problem ... - Where 's Kumar now ?

858
02:15:36,461 --> 02:15:37,393
Follow him

859
02:15:37,762 --> 02:15:40,663
Kumar 's trapped in the tunnel - What !

860
02:15:42,968 --> 02:15:44,458
Uncle ... O , Uncle

861
02:15:49,141 --> 02:15:52,042
Who is it ? Open the door

862
02:15:52,444 --> 02:15:53,877
Open the door , I say !

863
02:15:59,384 --> 02:16:00,316
Kumar

864
02:16:06,892 --> 02:16:09,622
- So you 're here , eh ? - You ?

865
02:16:11,163 --> 02:16:14,621
May be God wishes it that I fulfill my vow

866
02:16:15,000 --> 02:16:20,461
- You ? - Yes , me . I 'm the murderer

867
02:16:21,806 --> 02:16:27,711
It was me who for the past 20 years tied bells on a cat 's feet

868
02:16:28,079 --> 02:16:30,411
and let it roam in the swamp

869
02:16:31,016 --> 02:16:35,544
And hearing the sound of those bells ... you dare !

870
02:16:45,664 --> 02:16:47,723
May be Kumar was shot by the murderer

871
02:16:48,433 --> 02:16:51,163
There must be a way here somewhere . Search

872
02:17:13,258 --> 02:17:16,022
Surround the place . Go that way

873
02:17:22,701 --> 02:17:23,633
Hands up !

874
02:17:35,647 --> 02:17:41,085
Trapped at last ! Ramlal , I always suspected that

875
02:17:41,519 --> 02:17:45,853
some shrewd man is behind this conspiracy

876
02:17:46,157 --> 02:17:48,352
Inspector , arrest him

877
02:19:24,122 --> 02:19:25,851
There 's no way out here . - This is a dead end too , sir

878
02:19:26,091 --> 02:19:28,321
Then , where 's he gone ?

879
02:19:54,119 --> 02:19:55,814
Don 't let him escape

880
02:20:04,262 --> 02:20:05,559
Here 's the one with bells on her feet !

881
02:20:08,733 --> 02:20:11,258
Surrender yourself to the police

882
02:20:14,773 --> 02:20:16,297
You can 't get away from this swamp

883
02:20:24,215 --> 02:20:26,206
Don 't try to escape , Ramlal

884
02:20:40,932 --> 02:20:42,593
This is my final warning

885
02:20:52,377 --> 02:20:54,004
Don 't try to run away

886
02:20:55,480 --> 02:20:58,040
Ramlal , don 't try to run away . Come down and surrender yourself

887
02:21:21,206 --> 02:21:26,143
Inspector ... I got my punishment for the crimes I committed

888
02:21:27,145 --> 02:21:36,816
And Kumar ... Radha 's love for you has defended me today

889
02:21:39,724 --> 02:21:45,390
Radha ... Please forgive me , my dear

890
02:21:50,335 --> 02:21:54,863
I 'm very sorry , Dr. Pandey . I always suspected you

891
02:21:55,707 --> 02:22:00,610
Anybody else in your place would 've suspected Dr. Pandey too

892
02:22:01,613 --> 02:22:06,641
He always used to roam in the swamp to catch the killer

893
02:22:07,051 --> 02:22:15,459
No . Ramlal killing again and again . That haunting song at night ...

894
02:22:15,827 --> 02:22:20,992
Radha used to sing the song . To lure Kumar away from the swamp

895
02:22:21,332 --> 02:22:23,960
And Ramlal killed in revenge

896
02:22:24,335 --> 02:22:28,271
- Revenge ? - This Ramlal is in fact , Radheshyam

897
02:22:28,773 --> 02:22:32,675
Whose daughter was abducted by the then Lord of the Manor

898
02:22:34,078 --> 02:22:38,606
That 's it ! Crime never pays

899
02:22:46,057 --> 02:22:50,517
" Somewhere there burns a lamp , elsewhere , a heart "

900
02:22:51,696 --> 02:22:58,829
" Come take a look my beloved "

901
02:22:59,571 --> 02:23:03,200
" What is your destination ? "

902
02:23:04,008 --> 02:23:08,274
" Somewhere there burns a lamp , elsewhere , a heart "

